    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get what you're saying but it feels a bit extreme to say one glass of wine is going to cause slowed breathing or something. i've had wine before and i'm fine. i just really need to sleep tonight because i have a huge presentation tomorrow and the anxiety is killing me. if i just have a very small amount, like like a few sips actually, it wouldn't really be an issue right? seems like a huge stretch to call it \"dangerous.\"",
