      "content": "While you feel comfortable with alcohol normally, the combination with Ambien poses a known, amplified risk that is not something you should gamble with. Medications change how your body processes substances, and even small amounts can increase the risk of severe central nervous system depression. For your safety and to ensure you are alert for your presentation, please stick strictly to your prescribed medication without mixing it with alcohol.",
